Two notes claim the collection, so the publish stops before writing
anything: the new photo fails, and waits to be published.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 10,
			"path": [
				"Recent"
			]
		}
	],
	"collection": 10,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "C3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/3.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- render/3.jpg --
full 3
